    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet in a quiet and sought-after position within Oakton Park, this attractive three-bedroom semi-detached home offers generous, well-balanced accommodation with a wonderful sense of flow throughout. Thoughtfully extended and upgraded, the property is ideally suited to modern family life, with a purpose built extension to the side providing valuable additional living space and a larger kitchen creating a spacious and sociable heart to the home. The layout is both practical and versatile, offering plenty of room for a growing family while retaining a comfortable and welcoming feel.\n\nA particular feature is the separate study/TV room, a flexible space that can adapt to suit a variety of needs — whether as a home office, children's playroom, snug, study or additional entertaining space. The kitchen has been extended to maximise space and functionality, while upgraded appliances and a recently replaced boiler provide added comfort and peace of mind. The property also benefits from a private, south-facing garden, offering an excellent outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining and family life, with the added benefit of enjoying sunshine throughout much of the day.\n\nThe location is equally appealing, with Kilbogget Park just a ten-minute walk away, providing access to beautiful walks, open green spaces and a fantastic range of sports facilities. Killiney beach is also only a 15-minute walk away. Excellent transport links make commuting and getting around particularly convenient, while the home is also close to some of the area's best schools, making it an excellent choice for families. Combining a peaceful setting within the estate, generous living accommodation and a superb family-friendly location, this is a home that offers space, flexibility and convenience in equal measure.\n\nProperty Highlights\n\n- Three-bedroom semi-detached family home\n- Quiet position within Oakton Park\n- Converted garage providing valuable additional living space\n- Extended kitchen creating more space for growing families\n- Excellent flow and versatile accommodation\n- Separate study/TV room with a variety of potential uses\n- Upgraded kitchen appliances\n- Recently upgraded/replaced boiler\n- Private south-facing garden\n- Approximately 10-minute walk to Kilboggett Park, Killiney beach 15-minute walk\n- Close to beautiful walks and excellent sports facilities\n- Great transport links\n- Conveniently located close to some of the area's best schools"
      },
